WEBVTT

01:41.509 --> 01:45.950
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.770 --> 01:48.979
[Episode 13]

01:49.640 --> 01:50.350
Let go!

01:51.030 --> 01:52.030
Cut off my obsession!

02:18.640 --> 02:19.610
It's freezing cold.

02:21.470 --> 02:22.079
Stiffly Su...

02:25.140 --> 02:25.870
Are you alright?

02:32.520 --> 02:33.290
At this stage,

02:33.910 --> 02:34.960
what's the point of your obsession

02:35.380 --> 02:36.190
and wishful thinking?

02:36.860 --> 02:37.860
I know I don't deserve it.

02:38.870 --> 02:39.870
Nor do I hold onto wishful thinking.

02:40.910 --> 02:41.800
You may fool others,

02:42.090 --> 02:43.130
but can you fool yourself?

02:43.910 --> 02:45.190
You spend all day and night together.

02:45.560 --> 02:46.360
How can you avoid it?

02:47.030 --> 02:48.360
At this rate, you'll lose control sooner or later.

02:49.250 --> 02:50.320
Look at you now.

02:50.930 --> 02:52.079
The Ice Lotus Technique will kill you with pain one day.

02:54.920 --> 02:55.600
I'm fine.

02:58.910 --> 02:59.680
Although

03:00.240 --> 03:01.960
your punishment is self-inflicted,

03:02.620 --> 03:03.130
honestly,

03:05.190 --> 03:06.470
even I can't bear to see you go on like this.

03:07.930 --> 03:08.530
Moreover,

03:09.780 --> 03:10.960
can you stabilize your power

03:11.130 --> 03:12.130
to seal the Spirit Spring?

03:13.070 --> 03:14.160
I think about the task of sealing

03:14.870 --> 03:15.940
the Spirit Spring day and night.

03:16.470 --> 03:17.790
I remember it far more clearly than you.

03:19.630 --> 03:20.630
From today on,

03:21.070 --> 03:22.720
you'll be in charge of her cultivation in my place.

03:23.990 --> 03:25.000
And I will step aside,

03:26.520 --> 03:28.190
never appearing in front of her ever again.

03:31.630 --> 03:32.310
Rest assured,

03:33.280 --> 03:34.400
I'm a man

03:34.810 --> 03:36.130
of my word.

03:44.829 --> 03:45.950
How come,

03:45.970 --> 03:47.400
when Mr. Yu came that day,

03:47.970 --> 03:50.060
I didn't feel as exhilarated as before?

03:50.579 --> 03:51.630
Nor did I feel upset

03:51.660 --> 03:53.120
about his deep love

03:53.150 --> 03:54.310
for Master Mu.

03:55.079 --> 03:55.680
Instead, seeing

03:55.710 --> 03:56.800
so many female immortal masters

03:56.970 --> 03:58.090
coming for my master

03:58.590 --> 04:00.120
made me feel a bit bitter

04:00.140 --> 04:00.900
and uncomfortable inside.

04:01.630 --> 04:02.280
Moreover,

04:02.820 --> 04:03.560
when I

04:03.580 --> 04:04.990
offended Master today,

04:11.280 --> 04:12.880
although it was a bit abrupt and improper,

04:13.400 --> 04:14.590
the incense on him

04:14.590 --> 04:16.140
smelled so good.

04:21.000 --> 04:21.870
His eyes, brows,

04:22.200 --> 04:23.190
and his breath...

04:29.360 --> 04:29.950
Xue Ranran!

04:30.310 --> 04:31.310
What the heck are you thinking about?

04:32.570 --> 04:33.690
You're so wild

04:33.790 --> 04:35.380
and literally have no shame!

04:36.070 --> 04:37.080
Forget it, forget it now.

04:37.570 --> 04:38.980
What's the Oblivion Spell again?

04:43.130 --> 04:43.840
Why can't I get

04:43.870 --> 04:45.430
Master's face and body out of my head?

04:45.670 --> 04:47.020
I've even forgotten the Oblivion Spell!

04:50.060 --> 04:50.860
Ling Xiao,

04:51.560 --> 04:53.090
I can only rely on you now.

04:53.830 --> 04:55.560
I was hit by the Peach Blossom Intoxication today,

04:55.740 --> 04:57.210
losing control and offending my master,

04:57.800 --> 04:58.750
but actually,

04:59.460 --> 05:01.380
I feel a little happy inside.

05:01.510 --> 05:02.310
Why?

05:03.190 --> 05:04.040
Could it be that

05:04.270 --> 05:05.870
my real desire was stirred up

05:06.270 --> 05:07.430
by that spell, and I just did

05:07.680 --> 05:08.720
what I wanted to do?

05:09.680 --> 05:10.560
Do you think my reaction

05:10.560 --> 05:11.160
is...

05:14.310 --> 05:14.870
I haven't even said anything yet.

05:14.870 --> 05:16.120
How do you know what I'm going to ask?

05:17.720 --> 05:18.430
Do you think

05:19.310 --> 05:20.560
I'm in love with my master?

05:23.120 --> 05:23.860
Really?

05:24.640 --> 05:26.030
If this isn't love, then what is it?

05:30.670 --> 05:31.860
Freshly steamed bass.

05:31.890 --> 05:32.930
Master will surely like it.

05:32.950 --> 05:37.430
[Carefree Pavilion]

05:35.190 --> 05:35.800
Ranran.

05:36.980 --> 05:37.560
Mr. Zeng.

05:39.120 --> 05:40.270
Your master is in seclusion for cultivation.

05:40.630 --> 05:41.310
He's not seeing anyone.

05:41.920 --> 05:42.390
Oh, by the way.

05:42.840 --> 05:43.640
This is for you.

05:45.590 --> 05:47.250
[No.1 Resentful Couple of Immortal Sects]

05:46.830 --> 05:47.430
Ranran,

05:47.730 --> 05:48.390
you've already

05:48.440 --> 05:49.750
entered the Qi Cultivation Stage.

05:50.170 --> 05:50.870
And it's followed

05:50.890 --> 05:51.690
by the Foundation Phase.

05:52.120 --> 05:53.310
The quality of Foundation

05:53.730 --> 05:54.930
resembles a tree taking root.

05:55.870 --> 05:57.040
It exerts a direct influence

05:57.060 --> 05:58.060
on your path of cultivation.

05:58.740 --> 05:59.890
Your progress in cultivation

05:59.920 --> 06:01.360
is actually fast among the disciples.

06:01.510 --> 06:03.160
So you must remember that

06:03.510 --> 06:05.390
a bright future lies ahead of you.

06:05.800 --> 06:07.920
You must not let other things

06:07.940 --> 06:08.740
disrupt your cultivation.

06:10.360 --> 06:11.630
You wouldn't want

06:12.010 --> 06:13.010
your poor cultivation results

06:13.390 --> 06:14.630
to bring shame to your master, would you?

06:17.600 --> 06:18.270
Keep this in mind.

06:18.920 --> 06:19.950
You must look through

06:19.950 --> 06:21.430
every single word in this book

06:21.590 --> 06:23.760
and thoroughly comprehend the profound meaning within.

06:25.160 --> 06:26.040
Yes, Mr. Zeng.

06:26.120 --> 06:27.230
I will delve into it.

06:29.010 --> 06:30.540
As for this plate of fish,

06:30.690 --> 06:31.890
could you help me deliver it?

06:32.420 --> 06:32.900
Alright.

06:34.270 --> 06:35.040
Thank you, Mr. Zeng.

06:43.920 --> 06:44.680
What?

06:45.230 --> 06:46.659
A disciple falling in love with his or her master

06:46.750 --> 06:47.830
will be struck by lightning?

06:47.950 --> 06:48.830
That serious?

06:49.250 --> 06:50.360
It also mentions that years ago, my master

06:50.360 --> 06:51.190
was in love with my grandmaster,

06:51.210 --> 06:52.300
so they didn't have a good ending.

06:53.190 --> 06:53.750
Hold on.

06:54.560 --> 06:55.560
Mr. Zeng asked me

06:56.050 --> 06:57.010
to ponder

06:57.040 --> 06:58.120
the deeper meaning of this book.

06:59.560 --> 07:01.360
On the surface, this story

07:01.680 --> 07:02.510
is about the consequences

07:02.530 --> 07:04.130
of disciples coveting their masters.

07:05.040 --> 07:06.190
But come to think of it,

07:06.560 --> 07:08.000
doesn't this just mean

07:08.360 --> 07:09.240
there are so many people

07:09.240 --> 07:10.430
falling for their masters?

07:11.870 --> 07:13.270
So I'm not the only one

07:13.290 --> 07:14.240
who's in love with her master.

07:14.830 --> 07:15.310
Ling Xiao,

07:15.650 --> 07:16.570
that's it, right?

07:33.330 --> 07:34.100
The Guardian is in seclusion.

07:34.560 --> 07:35.230
No disturbances allowed.

07:36.040 --> 07:36.930
Mr. Yu Chen,

07:37.400 --> 07:38.930
if my master's not in the mood for a proper meal,

07:39.240 --> 07:40.720
would he like some snacks?

07:41.040 --> 07:42.310
I haven't sent him

07:42.330 --> 07:43.540
the dried longan I made last time.

07:44.450 --> 07:45.940
The Guardian never likes dried longan.

07:51.560 --> 07:53.120
Then I'll leave it on the table.

07:53.390 --> 07:54.630
If my master wants to have some,

07:54.820 --> 07:55.940
he can take it anytime.

08:24.370 --> 08:26.220
How can this person use my sister's sword technique?

08:29.880 --> 08:30.830
Who are you?

08:31.230 --> 08:32.070
Who sent you here?

08:32.289 --> 08:33.409
Don't you recognize me?

08:33.909 --> 08:34.820
Qingge, it's me,

08:34.890 --> 08:35.730
Zhou Feihua.

08:36.340 --> 08:37.299
Zhou Feihua?

08:38.460 --> 08:39.480
Madam Battle, please have mercy.

08:39.510 --> 08:40.470
That's Concubine Zhou.

08:45.910 --> 08:47.360
You taught me the sword techniques.

08:48.150 --> 08:48.870
You said

08:49.240 --> 08:50.080
you'd try me out

08:50.270 --> 08:51.390
after your return.

08:52.120 --> 08:53.480
I've always remembered this appointment.

08:56.470 --> 08:57.510
I've lost too much spiritual power

08:58.270 --> 08:59.440
in this rebirth.

09:00.060 --> 09:00.940
Many things from the past

09:01.630 --> 09:02.550
have slipped my mind.

09:05.570 --> 09:08.070
[Su Yu's Study, Eastern Palace]

09:05.750 --> 09:07.200
Qingge no longer recognizes Feihua?

09:07.790 --> 09:08.510
Your Highness,

09:08.720 --> 09:09.960
Madam Battle not only has no recollection

09:09.960 --> 09:10.840
of Concubine Zhou

09:11.080 --> 09:12.120
but also no longer

09:12.120 --> 09:12.840
hits it off

09:13.150 --> 09:14.000
with her.

09:15.810 --> 09:16.810
I once thought that

09:16.840 --> 09:18.270
with a friend in the palace,

09:18.990 --> 09:20.040
she could have fun.

09:20.910 --> 09:22.270
Didn't expect that she wouldn't recognize her.

09:22.840 --> 09:23.790
Please don't worry, Your Highness.

09:24.270 --> 09:24.960
Although Madam Battle

09:24.960 --> 09:26.120
doesn't remember Concubine Zhou,

09:26.480 --> 09:27.080
she still has you

09:27.080 --> 09:28.240
and those disciples to keep her company.

09:28.600 --> 09:30.030
I believe she won't feel lonely.

09:32.670 --> 09:33.750
She values loyalty the most.

09:34.850 --> 09:35.760
She continued to take care

09:35.790 --> 09:37.240
of her disciples right after her return.

09:37.630 --> 09:39.080
However, she has loads of disciples.

09:39.670 --> 09:41.120
I'm afraid the Eastern Palace can't fit them all.

09:42.170 --> 09:43.450
We need to clear up

09:43.480 --> 09:44.200
my residence outside the palace.

09:45.600 --> 09:46.150
Your Highness,

09:47.120 --> 09:48.030
Madam Battle only accepted

09:48.030 --> 09:49.360
Wang Suizhi and a few others.

09:49.550 --> 09:50.190
The rest of them

09:50.600 --> 09:51.630
were all kept outside the palace.

09:52.720 --> 09:53.840
Wang Suizhi?

09:54.080 --> 09:54.550
Yes.

09:55.030 --> 09:55.630
The one

09:55.630 --> 09:56.760
who can foresee fortune and wealth,

09:56.790 --> 09:57.550
the richest man

09:57.570 --> 09:58.930
who owns half of the restaurants in the capital?

09:59.320 --> 09:59.910
Exactly.

10:00.240 --> 10:01.510
Moreover, Madam Battle has agreed

10:01.750 --> 10:03.000
to take in Minister Lin's eldest son,

10:03.120 --> 10:04.310
Lin Yeting, as her disciple.

10:09.270 --> 10:10.840
Everyone in the capital knows Lin Yeting

10:10.840 --> 10:12.670
is an ignorant and spoiled good-for-nothing.

10:13.750 --> 10:15.200
How could Qingge take him in as her disciple?

10:17.140 --> 10:18.650
Good boys,

10:20.050 --> 10:21.380
you do show your respect for your master.

10:22.940 --> 10:23.850
Rise.

10:24.030 --> 10:25.420
Thank you, Master.

10:33.290 --> 10:34.250
Wang Suizhi,

10:35.240 --> 10:36.000
I remember you used to

10:36.020 --> 10:37.210
be very good at predicting wealth.

10:37.640 --> 10:38.640
It's as easy as a pie for you to tell

10:38.850 --> 10:39.900
where the treasures are.

10:41.120 --> 10:42.360
Can you still do this now?

10:43.360 --> 10:43.960
Of course.

10:45.390 --> 10:46.150
But, Master,

10:46.570 --> 10:47.540
you once said

10:48.080 --> 10:49.440
this skill would consume one's life force,

10:50.020 --> 10:50.850
so I shouldn't use it too often.

10:53.180 --> 10:54.490
But if you have any demand,

10:54.890 --> 10:56.850
I will surely try my best

10:57.320 --> 10:58.270
to help you find treasures.

11:01.350 --> 11:02.040
Master,

11:03.670 --> 11:05.070
do you have any clues about Wu's whereabouts?

11:08.180 --> 11:09.330
Why are you looking for her?

11:11.720 --> 11:12.840
After the great battle back then,

11:13.450 --> 11:14.790
Wu has been missing.

11:15.550 --> 11:16.320
I'm sorry, Master.

11:16.960 --> 11:18.130
I failed to find her.

11:20.030 --> 11:20.720
Fortunately,

11:21.870 --> 11:23.000
you're back now.

11:24.070 --> 11:25.160
You can surely figure out a way.

11:27.150 --> 11:28.480
That's so nice of you.

11:30.770 --> 11:31.720
But there's no need to search.

11:33.440 --> 11:34.290
She died

11:34.320 --> 11:35.550
in the Empyrean Bone Sacrifice Formation.

11:37.460 --> 11:38.740
Wu is dead?

11:48.440 --> 11:49.030
Remember,

11:50.890 --> 11:52.490
Mu Ranwu no longer exists in this world.

11:55.660 --> 11:57.180
[Madam Battle's Palace]

12:00.440 --> 12:01.480
You barely ate anything.

12:02.720 --> 12:03.600
Are you not hungry

12:04.960 --> 12:06.320
or is anything bothering you?

12:07.630 --> 12:08.150
Nothing.

12:12.550 --> 12:13.870
Father's been suffering old injuries

12:13.870 --> 12:15.000
from the battlefield.

12:15.840 --> 12:17.480
Now his health is taking a turn for the worse.

12:18.790 --> 12:19.870
Today he said

12:20.670 --> 12:22.080
he wanted you to make him some Health Pills.

12:24.910 --> 12:25.550
Make pills?

12:27.480 --> 12:28.030
I know

12:28.030 --> 12:29.320
you haven't fully recovered from the poison

12:29.640 --> 12:30.640
of Resentment Liquid.

12:31.120 --> 12:32.080
So I have

12:32.110 --> 12:32.960
reported to Father.

12:33.500 --> 12:34.420
No rush for this matter.

12:35.390 --> 12:36.670
Your rehabilitation is what matters most.

12:39.460 --> 12:40.290
Anyway, I already have

12:40.320 --> 12:41.390
Qingge's spiritual power.

12:41.930 --> 12:42.720
It should be easy

12:43.330 --> 12:44.550
to make a pill.

12:48.700 --> 12:49.500
I see.

12:53.200 --> 12:53.910
I heard

12:53.960 --> 12:55.680
you found a treasure for me.

12:56.440 --> 12:57.050
What a coincidence,

12:57.660 --> 12:58.810
I've got a gift

12:58.840 --> 12:59.630
for you too.

13:00.050 --> 13:00.650
That's great.

13:11.270 --> 13:12.480
This is the Luminous Pearl from the North Sea.

13:13.490 --> 13:14.940
There's only one every thousand years.

13:15.600 --> 13:16.550
It's been kept by the imperial family

13:16.550 --> 13:17.750
as a precious heirloom for generations,

13:18.480 --> 13:19.670
most suited to your status

13:19.960 --> 13:20.790
as the Crown Prince.

13:21.790 --> 13:22.980
I'm sure you'll like it.

13:25.490 --> 13:26.200
Yes...

13:30.510 --> 13:31.670
And what's your gift for me?

13:39.440 --> 13:39.870
Here you are.

13:42.790 --> 13:44.220
The pearl pendant bestowed by His Majesty?

13:48.560 --> 13:50.510
Can't believe you're giving me such a precious thing!

13:53.730 --> 13:54.850
I'm glad you like it.

14:16.120 --> 14:17.920
I wonder when His Majesty

14:18.690 --> 14:20.140
will recover.

14:21.910 --> 14:23.480
I wish we could get married

14:23.500 --> 14:24.340
soon.

14:27.480 --> 14:28.480
I came back to life

14:28.910 --> 14:30.360
specifically for you.

14:31.420 --> 14:32.490
You can't fail me.

14:33.360 --> 14:34.080
Qingge,

14:36.270 --> 14:38.790
I will protect you with my life this time.

14:40.870 --> 14:42.320
If you feel stifled in the palace,

14:43.240 --> 14:44.790
you can go catch up

14:45.960 --> 14:46.550
with Feihua.

14:49.410 --> 14:49.840
Fehua?

14:52.840 --> 14:53.870
She's no more than

14:53.870 --> 14:54.840
a crude person

14:54.840 --> 14:55.910
obsessed with swordplay.

14:56.630 --> 14:58.390
She relied on the Zhou family's power

14:59.170 --> 15:00.560
to grab the position of the Crown Princess.

15:04.770 --> 15:06.020
Luckily, I came back

15:07.000 --> 15:08.000
and didn't let her get it.

15:15.450 --> 15:16.780
Feihua is a good girl.

15:17.140 --> 15:18.330
We hit it off right away.

15:19.070 --> 15:21.000
It's just that this place full of intrigues and schemes

15:21.200 --> 15:22.150
is not suitable for someone

15:22.150 --> 15:23.200
as pure-hearted as her.

15:24.010 --> 15:24.880
I don't want her to become

15:24.910 --> 15:26.030
a political sacrifice.

15:27.070 --> 15:28.310
You must protect her well.

15:37.670 --> 15:38.390
What's wrong?

15:39.600 --> 15:40.360
I just remembered

15:40.360 --> 15:41.670
I've got some state affairs to attend to.

15:42.610 --> 15:43.670
I'll come see you next time.

15:53.140 --> 15:56.630
[Courtyard in Zhou Feihua's Palace]

16:07.610 --> 16:08.900
Your Highness, what brings you here?

16:11.360 --> 16:12.690
I'll trade this for your sword performance.

16:19.750 --> 16:21.050
Your Highness, you used to watch my swordplay

16:21.080 --> 16:22.840
to reminisce about Master Mu.

16:23.440 --> 16:24.150
But now,

16:24.200 --> 16:25.360
she's right here in the palace.

16:25.970 --> 16:26.760
Why do you still need me?

16:28.390 --> 16:29.480
She is back.

16:30.480 --> 16:31.480
But she's not quite

16:31.510 --> 16:32.360
the same as I remember.

16:32.960 --> 16:34.080
She used to

16:35.000 --> 16:36.440
always care about others.

16:37.910 --> 16:39.200
Now, after her rebirth,

16:40.550 --> 16:42.030
she's more focused on herself.

16:43.960 --> 16:45.630
It's not necessarily a bad thing.

16:47.080 --> 16:48.240
With a second chance at life,

16:49.260 --> 16:50.610
there should be some differences.

16:52.170 --> 16:53.640
Having been through so much and got a second chance at life,

16:54.190 --> 16:56.040
she needs some time to adapt, of course.

16:57.290 --> 16:58.760
Once she gets her memory back,

17:00.610 --> 17:01.490
I'll drink and exchange

17:01.840 --> 17:02.750
swordplay ideas with her again.

17:53.680 --> 17:54.270
Today,

17:54.370 --> 17:55.680
I will teach you the sword formation.

17:56.310 --> 17:57.740
Why is it you teaching the class, Mr. Zeng?

17:58.000 --> 17:58.750
Where's my master?

18:00.060 --> 18:00.880
He's in seclusion.

18:01.300 --> 18:02.390
I'll be taking over from now on.

18:10.070 --> 18:10.980
Ms. Yu Tong.

18:36.150 --> 18:38.370
[One Year Later]

18:40.840 --> 18:41.440
Guys,

18:42.310 --> 18:43.110
the Wester Sect's

18:43.130 --> 18:44.280
annual small test

18:44.330 --> 18:45.160
has ended today.

18:45.680 --> 18:47.110
Congratulations to Ranran for winning first place

18:47.200 --> 18:48.590
and becoming Mount Wester's chief disciple.

18:53.750 --> 18:54.270
Ranran,

18:54.950 --> 18:56.080
this jade pendant represents the identity

18:56.110 --> 18:56.920
of the chief disciple.

18:57.230 --> 18:58.270
I'm granting it to you today.

18:58.790 --> 19:00.070
From now on, you're the Wester Sect's chief disciple.

19:07.060 --> 19:08.680
My master won't even show up to see me

19:09.030 --> 19:10.400
becoming his chief disciple?

19:13.280 --> 19:14.200
He

19:15.090 --> 19:16.130
hasn't finished his seclusion yet.

19:17.030 --> 19:17.560
Oh, right,

19:18.190 --> 19:20.080
Follow me to the Forbidden Valley first.

19:21.640 --> 19:22.110
Let's go.

19:29.620 --> 19:31.720
Didn't expect it would be our little junior

19:31.750 --> 19:32.880
who took the first place.

19:33.600 --> 19:34.940
We're only in the early stage of Qi Cultivation,

19:34.960 --> 19:36.120
while Ranran is already in the middle stage.

19:36.160 --> 19:37.440
Why couldn't she win first place?

19:39.510 --> 19:40.990
Never thought Ranran's spiritual power

19:41.020 --> 19:42.300
would soar so quickly.

19:43.030 --> 19:44.400
We should also step up our cultivation.

19:46.710 --> 19:47.880
[Forbidden Valley, Mount Wester]

20:00.360 --> 20:01.560
Here are the cultivation methods

20:01.590 --> 20:02.640
specifically for the Formless Spirit Root

20:02.640 --> 20:03.440
collected by our Wester Sect.

20:04.440 --> 20:05.480
Plus the unique energy landscape

20:05.510 --> 20:06.680
of this Forbidden Valley,

20:07.010 --> 20:08.180
they'll help you solidify your foundation.

20:08.610 --> 20:09.510
Your future advancements

20:09.530 --> 20:10.530
will be much smoother and quicker.

20:12.810 --> 20:13.720
For the next six months,

20:14.070 --> 20:15.160
you need to practice in the valley

20:15.180 --> 20:16.180
for three hours every day.

20:16.740 --> 20:17.870
I will guide and guard you

20:18.270 --> 20:19.030
in the valley.

20:19.280 --> 20:20.650
Isn't it said that after becoming the chief disciple,

20:21.000 --> 20:21.830
I can be guarded by my master

20:21.850 --> 20:22.720
during cultivation?

20:22.960 --> 20:24.480
Has my master still not made a breakthrough

20:24.750 --> 20:25.790
after such a long time of seclusion?

20:29.510 --> 20:30.680
Thank you for your help, Mr. Zeng.

20:32.360 --> 20:32.880
How is it?

20:33.240 --> 20:34.000
Have you remembered them all?

20:35.320 --> 20:36.200
Let's begin then.

20:42.410 --> 20:43.570
Gather qi in my heart,

20:44.350 --> 20:45.540
store it gently,

20:46.270 --> 20:47.480
enter the spiritual realm,

20:47.900 --> 20:49.100
pass through it smoothly,

20:49.640 --> 20:50.830
circulate through the meridians,

20:51.270 --> 20:52.550
and form it like Mount Wester.

21:11.570 --> 21:12.930
I've been in seclusion for a year

21:13.440 --> 21:14.520
and barely managed to maintain

21:14.550 --> 21:16.030
my power at the early Nascent Soul stage.

21:16.310 --> 21:17.310
Su Yishui,

21:17.480 --> 21:19.200
I will definitely settle this score with you.

21:22.500 --> 21:24.780
Welcome back from seclusion, My Lord.

21:25.640 --> 21:26.240
Rise.

21:26.480 --> 21:27.960
Thank you, My Lord.

21:32.390 --> 21:33.640
Have you found the Spirit Spring?

21:34.060 --> 21:35.910
I have searched the mortal world for a year,

21:36.610 --> 21:38.170
but still no clues about the Spirit Spring's whereabouts.

21:40.160 --> 21:41.920
I've been in seclusion for over a year,

21:42.490 --> 21:44.330
and this is what you've got for me, Elder Tu?

21:52.310 --> 21:53.510
Given your merits in guarding during my seclusion,

21:54.030 --> 21:55.270
I can forget about

21:55.900 --> 21:56.730
your failure for now.

22:28.190 --> 22:29.390
My Lord, this is...

22:30.130 --> 22:32.000
Convert the spiritual power of our Scarlet Sect's mountains

22:32.020 --> 22:32.870
into resentment,

22:33.240 --> 22:34.310
gather it on the Blazing Sword,

22:34.750 --> 22:35.720
then use the sword

22:35.740 --> 22:37.220
to resonate with the Spirit Spring,

22:37.870 --> 22:39.590
and offer the resentment to the Spirit Spring

22:40.110 --> 22:41.480
to help it break through the seal.

22:42.000 --> 22:43.110
This way,

22:43.440 --> 22:44.680
we can surely find the Spirit Spring.

22:57.830 --> 22:58.350
Wei Jiu?

23:00.000 --> 23:01.750
He's using resentment to search for the Spirit Spring.

23:18.610 --> 23:20.210
Was that Master just now?

23:20.680 --> 23:21.400
Or

23:22.160 --> 23:23.590
am I just missing Master too much

23:24.160 --> 23:25.600
and imagining things?

23:29.390 --> 23:30.070
There seemed to be

23:30.070 --> 23:31.110
an earthquake in the valley just now.

23:31.470 --> 23:32.070
Are you alright?

23:32.810 --> 23:33.540
I'm fine.

23:34.240 --> 23:34.830
Mr. Zeng,

23:35.480 --> 23:37.000
has my master come out of seclusion today?

23:38.470 --> 23:39.560
It's still early for him to come out.

23:40.160 --> 23:41.070
Focus on your cultivation.

23:41.240 --> 23:42.200
Don't worry about anything else.

23:44.940 --> 23:45.620
Keep cultivating.

23:54.480 --> 23:55.000
Ling Xiao.

23:56.440 --> 23:57.680
Did you see clearly just now?

23:57.970 --> 23:59.020
Was that my master?

24:03.160 --> 24:04.880
So was that really Master?

24:22.910 --> 24:24.380
[Deep Underground, Puxin Village]

24:34.400 --> 24:37.350
[Riverside, Wangxiang Pass]

24:52.250 --> 24:52.900
Someone died!

24:55.700 --> 24:57.100
[Barracks, Wangxiang Pass]

25:09.160 --> 25:09.550
Oh, no!

25:09.750 --> 25:10.680
Go inform Master of this anomaly

25:10.880 --> 25:11.720
about the Spirit Spring.

25:12.170 --> 25:13.480
The Spirit Spring's acting up severely this time.

25:13.690 --> 25:15.080
Seems like it's about to break through the seal.

25:15.680 --> 25:16.960
All sects need to join hands

25:17.150 --> 25:18.500
to find the Spirit Spring as soon as possible.

25:19.120 --> 25:20.080
Mu Qingge

25:20.110 --> 25:21.480
claimed to not know the whereabouts

25:21.510 --> 25:22.450
of the Spirit Spring,

25:22.480 --> 25:23.090
but in the next moment,

25:23.400 --> 25:24.640
she just harmed Immortal Kaiyuan.

25:25.240 --> 25:25.920
Her words

25:26.030 --> 25:27.160
can't be trusted.

25:27.990 --> 25:28.550
Hong Shan,

25:28.860 --> 25:29.940
go keep an eye on Mu Qingge.

25:31.240 --> 25:31.640
Yes.

25:45.940 --> 25:46.540
You and I

25:46.570 --> 25:47.860
are clearly the same kind of person.

25:49.060 --> 25:50.690
Who cares what methods I use?

25:51.160 --> 25:52.290
As long as I can kill you.

25:54.010 --> 25:54.720
One wisp of qi

25:56.360 --> 25:57.080
to break the galaxy!

26:03.750 --> 26:04.400
Ling Xiao,

26:05.100 --> 26:05.900
did I just

26:05.930 --> 26:07.290
enter your memories?

26:09.270 --> 26:09.750
Your memories

26:09.750 --> 26:11.110
are the memories of your soul owner.

26:11.650 --> 26:12.040
Then,

26:12.480 --> 26:13.350
is my previous incarnation

26:13.350 --> 26:14.310
one of those people?

26:15.920 --> 26:16.680
The female immortal master

26:16.680 --> 26:17.790
attacked by Wei Jiu

26:18.070 --> 26:19.110
is my previous incarnation?

26:28.300 --> 26:29.980
The young man who appeared just now

26:30.160 --> 26:31.240
is your soul owner?

26:32.800 --> 26:33.690
You were going to kill me?

26:34.440 --> 26:34.880
No,

26:35.270 --> 26:36.880
Your soul owner wanted to kill my previous incarnation.

26:37.240 --> 26:37.830
Why?

26:40.500 --> 26:41.830
Can't believe that hideous demon Wei Jiu

26:42.310 --> 26:44.240
said I was the same kind of person as him.

26:45.030 --> 26:45.480
Could it be that

26:46.030 --> 26:47.470
my previous incarnation was also a bad guy?

26:48.640 --> 26:50.030
Is it just because of this

26:50.510 --> 26:51.720
that Master didn't tell me the truth?

26:52.720 --> 26:53.160
Ling Xiao,

26:53.630 --> 26:54.650
can't you recall

26:54.680 --> 26:55.790
some other memories?

27:01.000 --> 27:01.960
Master said

27:02.330 --> 27:03.580
this branch of the Reincarnation Tree

27:03.820 --> 27:05.110
is connected to my heart.

27:09.640 --> 27:11.680
My Spirit Root has fully grown on its own!

27:13.510 --> 27:14.130
Ling Xiao,

27:14.960 --> 27:16.310
my spiritual power has nourished you,

27:16.770 --> 27:17.800
so you can share

27:17.830 --> 27:18.780
these memories with me,

27:19.030 --> 27:19.590
right?

27:23.780 --> 27:25.510
As long as I become stronger through cultivation,

27:26.030 --> 27:27.240
I will remember

27:27.270 --> 27:28.030
some other things.

27:49.960 --> 27:51.570
This place is still as cold as before.

27:54.620 --> 27:55.550
Ling Xiao's soul owner,

27:55.930 --> 27:57.010
nice to meet you again.

27:57.590 --> 27:58.960
I saw you in Ling Xiao's memories

27:58.960 --> 27:59.590
just now.

28:00.420 --> 28:01.700
I've thought it through.

28:02.720 --> 28:04.310
There must be some misunderstanding between us.

28:06.000 --> 28:06.790
Although

28:07.280 --> 28:08.970
it seemed like you wanted to kill me,

28:09.440 --> 28:11.000
it could also be that you were trying to protect me.

28:12.010 --> 28:13.640
I feel like we've been

28:13.760 --> 28:15.190
entangled for a very long time.

28:16.240 --> 28:18.650
What exactly is our relationship?

28:19.920 --> 28:21.480
Maybe I'll find it out in the future.

28:22.510 --> 28:23.400
This time, I've come here

28:23.540 --> 28:24.320
with new thoughts on my mind

28:24.350 --> 28:25.110
that I want to share with you.

28:26.070 --> 28:27.520
During this year and a half of cultivation,

28:27.740 --> 28:29.150
I've not only improved my power

28:29.960 --> 28:30.590
but also

28:31.020 --> 28:31.930
gained a better understanding

28:31.950 --> 28:33.100
of my own heart.

28:34.350 --> 28:35.590
I do like my master.

28:39.590 --> 28:40.690
That day, everything I did

28:40.720 --> 28:41.640
due to the Peach Blossom Intoxication

28:42.400 --> 28:43.480
was actually what I truly

28:43.590 --> 28:44.880
thought and felt inside.

28:47.270 --> 28:48.400
Immortal techniques may deceive people,

28:49.160 --> 28:49.920
but the feelings at that time

28:49.920 --> 28:50.880
couldn't be fake.

28:53.160 --> 28:53.920
At that time,

28:54.610 --> 28:55.850
when getting close to him,

28:57.290 --> 28:58.240
my heart raced.

29:02.860 --> 29:03.510
Later,

29:04.680 --> 29:05.870
when I couldn't see him,

29:07.670 --> 29:08.720
I would miss him.

29:13.160 --> 29:14.210
In the Forbidden Valley,

29:14.240 --> 29:15.150
even an illusion of him

29:15.350 --> 29:16.310
would excite me.

29:18.370 --> 29:19.720
If this isn't love,

29:19.940 --> 29:20.830
then what else

29:20.830 --> 29:21.790
can be called love?

29:22.840 --> 29:24.280
Now I understand the book

29:24.310 --> 29:25.440
Mr. Zeng gave me.

29:26.160 --> 29:27.590
I actually feel that the people recorded in the book

29:27.590 --> 29:28.680
were all too hesitant.

29:29.690 --> 29:31.410
They didn't speak up and confess their feelings,

29:31.720 --> 29:32.880
causing many misunderstandings

29:33.150 --> 29:34.430
and ending up as resentful lovers.

29:35.590 --> 29:37.110
Even if the one who covets her master

29:35.620 --> 29:40.040
♫Gradually gravitate toward you by love♫

29:37.110 --> 29:37.960
will be struck by lightning,

29:38.310 --> 29:39.140
then bring it on.

29:40.660 --> 29:45.740
♫Words are too weak to tell the whole story♫

29:44.190 --> 29:44.780
Tomorrow

29:45.160 --> 29:46.510
is the day I end my seclusion.

29:45.770 --> 29:50.560
♫Only after I met you♫

29:47.310 --> 29:47.790
There will be

29:47.790 --> 29:49.180
Paired Wings Auspicious Cloud on Mount Wester.

29:49.790 --> 29:51.350
I heard that making a wish and confessing

29:50.880 --> 29:58.690
♫Did I realize there are heaven-like places all because of you♫

29:51.590 --> 29:53.000
to the one you love under this phenomenon

29:53.030 --> 29:53.880
will be blessed with success.

29:54.350 --> 29:55.750
I plan to invite my master to come along.

29:58.970 --> 30:03.980
♫Maybe a lifetime is too short, too fleeting♫

30:04.010 --> 30:09.240
♫So we were granted a second chance♫

30:08.480 --> 30:09.160
Forget it

30:09.610 --> 30:14.650
♫Use our unfinished fate♫

30:10.030 --> 30:12.750
I don't know how long you've been trapped here,

30:13.200 --> 30:14.160
and if your silence

30:14.880 --> 30:17.160
is a punishment given to you by others

30:14.980 --> 30:18.800
♫To fulfill your love for each other♫

30:17.550 --> 30:18.640
or by yourself.

30:19.250 --> 30:26.590
♫Until the end of our lives, even if it's with an illusion♫

30:20.640 --> 30:22.510
You seem aloof and ascetic

30:22.720 --> 30:24.000
just like my master,

30:24.640 --> 30:25.720
all alone,

30:26.400 --> 30:28.590
never sharing thoughts with others.

30:27.130 --> 30:30.570
♫I'll risk everything♫

30:29.240 --> 30:29.640
Well,

30:30.200 --> 30:31.400
being trapped here alone,

30:30.880 --> 30:35.510
♫Just because I'm destined to reunite with you again♫

30:31.640 --> 30:32.470
do you

30:32.640 --> 30:33.880
also have someone you miss?

30:36.250 --> 30:40.170
♫We fulfill the vow forged through many lifetimes♫

30:40.580 --> 30:45.630
♫From now onwards♫

31:01.980 --> 31:03.110
You have completed the third stage of Qi Cultivation.

31:03.560 --> 31:04.400
Congratulations, Ranran.

31:04.640 --> 31:05.640
You can end your seclusion now.

31:09.160 --> 31:10.550
Will Master accept my invitation

31:11.200 --> 31:13.030
to watch the Paired Wings Auspicious Cloud with me?

31:33.040 --> 31:34.090
The Paired Wings Auspicious Cloud?

31:39.200 --> 31:40.020
Paired Wings Auspicious Cloud,

31:40.200 --> 31:41.160
please listen to my wish.

31:41.540 --> 31:42.620
I wish Master and I...

31:48.500 --> 31:50.220
Where did this wind come from all of a sudden?

31:56.590 --> 31:57.860
I wish Master and I...

32:12.640 --> 32:13.160
Ranran.

32:16.660 --> 32:17.400
Master!

32:19.950 --> 32:20.710
Master!

32:21.550 --> 32:22.590
It's been over a year since we last met.

32:23.170 --> 32:24.460
I've been missing you.

32:25.900 --> 32:26.620
I have something

32:27.240 --> 32:28.240
to tell you.

32:28.880 --> 32:29.160
I...

32:29.160 --> 32:30.240
You are about to build your Foundation.

32:32.200 --> 32:33.680
At that time, you will need to choose your own path.

32:34.560 --> 32:36.270
I would like to hear your choice.

32:39.820 --> 32:41.260
Since I started practicing the Unfeeling Mantra,

32:41.960 --> 32:43.400
I've deeply felt the profundity of this path.

32:44.520 --> 32:46.110
In the world of cultivation,

32:47.000 --> 32:48.240
the hardest part is cultivating the heart.

32:53.790 --> 32:54.880
Once you decide to take the path,

32:55.790 --> 32:56.920
you must constantly hold onto it

32:56.940 --> 32:57.830
without losing control.

33:00.680 --> 33:01.720
Be it the Feeling Mantra

33:01.720 --> 33:02.510
or the Unfeeling Mantra,

33:03.110 --> 33:03.920
once you've made your choice,

33:04.590 --> 33:05.680
you must stick to it.

33:06.950 --> 33:07.840
Losing control

33:08.270 --> 33:09.310
means an unstable foundation.

33:10.830 --> 33:11.640
For you,

33:12.510 --> 33:13.790
this is the first priority.

33:24.750 --> 33:26.030
How unlucky.

33:27.110 --> 33:28.880
The Auspicious Cloud dispersed for no reason.

33:29.960 --> 33:31.510
I finally saw Master,

33:32.620 --> 33:34.530
but I didn't get to say what I wanted

33:35.910 --> 33:37.150
and even got lectured instead.

33:43.920 --> 33:44.880
Is that you, Yu?

33:51.770 --> 33:53.140
What has the Crown Prince been busy with lately?

33:53.760 --> 33:55.000
Why has he been coming here

33:55.000 --> 33:55.930
less and less often?

33:55.960 --> 33:56.830
Please calm down, Your Highness.

33:58.750 --> 33:59.310
So what's the matter?

34:02.430 --> 34:03.060
Your Highness,

34:03.460 --> 34:04.400
there is an immortal master

34:04.420 --> 34:06.250
named Wen Hongshan outside the palace requesting to see you.

34:09.179 --> 34:10.260
What's she here for?

34:13.800 --> 34:14.440
You may leave.

34:16.480 --> 34:17.230
-Yes.
-Yes.

34:21.989 --> 34:23.810
Immortal Master Wen, you once rejected my proposal

34:23.840 --> 34:25.710
on Mount Absolute without hesitation.

34:26.400 --> 34:26.920
What?

34:27.400 --> 34:28.440
You regret it now?

34:30.440 --> 34:32.030
I shouldn't have let jealousy get the better of me

34:32.239 --> 34:33.360
and hurt Immortal Master Wen's face.

34:33.750 --> 34:34.900
I'm willing to sacrifice my own spiritual power

34:35.250 --> 34:36.510
to heal the scar on your face.

34:39.110 --> 34:40.739
Didn't expect you to come all the way to the capital

34:40.770 --> 34:42.040
for such a trifle.

34:42.800 --> 34:43.480
Say it.

34:44.170 --> 34:45.449
How do you want me to make it up to you?

34:46.889 --> 34:47.920
Sacrifice my spiritual power

34:48.510 --> 34:50.110
or use these treasures as compensation?

34:50.600 --> 34:51.440
Stop pretending.

34:52.260 --> 34:54.050
You're definitely not Mu Qingge.

34:57.360 --> 34:59.070
Why are you talking nonsense?

35:00.230 --> 35:01.550
Earlier on Mount Absolute, you brought up

35:01.570 --> 35:03.460
how Mu Qingge injured me.

35:03.840 --> 35:04.710
However,

35:06.220 --> 35:07.320
this scar of mine

35:07.670 --> 35:09.460
was actually not caused by her.

35:12.450 --> 35:13.560
I went to Mount Wester back then

35:13.590 --> 35:14.880
to bring Yishui back.

35:15.480 --> 35:17.440
In order to make Yishui change his mind,

35:17.890 --> 35:20.080
I claimed that she deliberately disfigured my face.

35:20.910 --> 35:22.500
If you were really Mu Qingge,

35:22.840 --> 35:23.590
you wouldn't be unaware

35:23.610 --> 35:24.740
of the hidden story behind it.

35:25.510 --> 35:26.840
Am I right,

35:27.680 --> 35:28.760
Mu Ranwu?

35:32.120 --> 35:32.850
Where is she?

35:34.070 --> 35:35.230
Why are you pretending to be her?

35:35.500 --> 35:36.390
Nonsense!

35:37.900 --> 35:39.170
I am Mu Qingge.

35:41.290 --> 35:42.490
Even Su Yishui has acknowledged

35:42.520 --> 35:43.440
that I am Mu Qingge.

35:46.340 --> 35:47.440
It did surprise me

35:47.440 --> 35:48.630
that you could remove

35:48.800 --> 35:50.360
Yishui's Face-and-Heart Burning Curse.

35:51.420 --> 35:52.170
However,

35:53.180 --> 35:54.930
a fake can never become real.

35:58.370 --> 36:00.040
We're both well aware of this.

36:01.800 --> 36:03.110
What on earth do you want?

36:04.690 --> 36:06.600
I want to see the real Mu Qingge.

36:07.050 --> 36:07.970
Where is she?

36:09.510 --> 36:10.280
I don't know.

36:12.320 --> 36:13.440
The other fruit

36:14.510 --> 36:15.360
was pushed off the tree

36:15.380 --> 36:16.450
10 years ago.

36:17.440 --> 36:18.070
Do you think

36:19.850 --> 36:20.840
she would still be alive?

36:21.490 --> 36:22.420
She's dead?

36:24.470 --> 36:25.760
Mu Qingge

36:26.760 --> 36:28.150
wouldn't die so easily.

36:29.240 --> 36:30.370
Only the real Mu Qingge

36:30.400 --> 36:32.030
knows the whereabouts of the Spirit Spring.

36:32.590 --> 36:34.000
You and she are both Reincarnation Fruits,

36:34.020 --> 36:34.870
and you're her sister.

36:35.840 --> 36:36.600
It should be easier for you

36:36.630 --> 36:37.670
to find her than others.

36:38.670 --> 36:40.070
So long as you tell me

36:40.090 --> 36:40.900
where she is,

36:41.270 --> 36:42.800
I will stay out of your affairs.

36:43.840 --> 36:44.510
Otherwise,

36:44.960 --> 36:46.670
I will reveal your true identity

36:47.000 --> 36:48.190
to everyone.

37:09.020 --> 37:09.830
Where are you?

37:11.490 --> 37:13.230
I will find you.

37:14.690 --> 37:15.560
Because you

37:17.480 --> 37:18.560
must die.

37:21.190 --> 37:22.230
You did behave

37:22.250 --> 37:23.170
like a strict teacher today.

37:29.090 --> 37:30.340
In just a year and a half,

37:30.790 --> 37:32.620
Ranran has already reached the third stage of Qi Cultivation.

37:33.190 --> 37:33.630
Of course,

37:34.050 --> 37:35.510
this is also thanks to your guidance

37:35.530 --> 37:36.570
as her master.

37:38.930 --> 37:39.810
Still too slow.

37:40.630 --> 37:41.510
The Spirit-Nourishing Pill

37:41.510 --> 37:42.880
can last in Mu Ranwu's body for a year and a half at most.

37:43.510 --> 37:44.880
Before she realizes it, we must help Ranran

37:45.310 --> 37:46.270
build her Foundation

37:46.710 --> 37:48.140
so as to protect Ranran's heart.

37:49.880 --> 37:51.320
If you want her to build her Foundation quickly,

37:51.710 --> 37:52.280
why not try

37:52.280 --> 37:53.440
the old method in the Immortal Realm,

37:54.030 --> 37:55.000
letting her go down the mountain

37:55.400 --> 37:56.030
to train for merits?

37:59.000 --> 37:59.550
Good idea.

38:00.580 --> 38:01.620
Training for merits is the biggest boost

38:01.920 --> 38:02.760
to Foundation building.

38:06.400 --> 38:07.710
The Yin Eye Stone's reaction...

38:08.580 --> 38:09.680
Has the talisman formation you set up

38:09.710 --> 38:10.710
sensed the Spirit Spring?

38:12.800 --> 38:14.110
Judging from the compass,

38:14.630 --> 38:16.150
it seems to be in the northwest direction.

38:17.280 --> 38:19.240
Here's His Majesty's verbal edict.

38:19.990 --> 38:21.470
Due to continuous rain

38:21.630 --> 38:22.840
and frequent earthquakes for months,

38:23.000 --> 38:24.770
the rivers are flooding.

38:25.030 --> 38:27.550
The waterways around the capital

38:27.590 --> 38:29.200
have all suffered from collapses

38:29.230 --> 38:30.760
or sand blockages.

38:31.140 --> 38:34.620
The imperial court has spent over 100,000 taels of silver,

38:34.740 --> 38:36.940
yet the floods remain severe.

38:37.310 --> 38:40.270
This is due to the Crown Prince's failure in regency.

38:40.630 --> 38:42.440
The Crown Prince shall depart immediately

38:42.460 --> 38:43.610
to inspect all provinces,

38:43.740 --> 38:45.410
oversee river management,

38:45.630 --> 38:47.030
comfort disaster victims,

38:47.200 --> 38:48.510
and make amends for the failure.

38:48.780 --> 38:49.960
This is His Majesty's command.

38:50.920 --> 38:52.280
I will obey the order.

38:59.270 --> 39:00.140
Eunuch Fu,

39:00.510 --> 39:02.960
the ceremony to worship Heaven is at the end of this month.

39:03.000 --> 39:05.600
Sending His Highness to deal with the river problems now

39:05.830 --> 39:08.020
means he won't be able to return in time.

39:08.610 --> 39:10.090
Please don't worry about this, Your Highness.

39:10.640 --> 39:13.990
The Third Prince has taken over the duty of presiding over the ceremony.

39:16.970 --> 39:18.780
Why did Father suddenly change his mind?

39:19.880 --> 39:20.760
Your Highness,

39:21.480 --> 39:23.630
His Majesty is in poor health.

39:23.760 --> 39:27.390
The Third Prince fasts and prays for His Majesty's blessings every day.

39:28.030 --> 39:31.670
Yet your residence is gathering gold, silver, and jewels in abundance.

39:32.250 --> 39:33.290
Moreover,

39:33.610 --> 39:34.970
Madam Battle once promised

39:35.000 --> 39:36.900
to make Health Pills for His Majesty.

39:37.560 --> 39:38.960
It's been a year,

39:39.130 --> 39:40.330
and there are still no pills.

39:40.760 --> 39:43.280
So His Majesty got mad

39:43.710 --> 39:44.590
and sent you

39:44.840 --> 39:46.720
to deal with the waterways.

39:50.800 --> 39:52.030
I'll take my leave, Your Highness.

39:57.110 --> 39:58.190
It must be the Third Prince,

39:58.520 --> 39:59.890
whispering nonsense in His Majesty's ear again.

40:01.900 --> 40:02.450
Your Highness,

40:02.720 --> 40:03.960
please hurry to the palace and explain it.

40:04.260 --> 40:05.420
There might still be a chance.

40:05.480 --> 40:06.360
There's no need.

40:08.360 --> 40:09.760
As wise as His Highness is,

40:10.050 --> 40:12.530
everything is under his control.

40:13.960 --> 40:16.200
So fixing the rivers was your plan all along, Your Highness?

40:19.590 --> 40:20.570
Su Yishui!

40:22.530 --> 40:24.380
I want to meet Su Yishui!

40:23.700 --> 40:27.290
[Wester Sect]

40:26.960 --> 40:27.400
Su...

40:28.280 --> 40:29.070
Who are you?

40:29.400 --> 40:30.360
Why do you want from the Guardian?

40:30.760 --> 40:32.110
I am Qin Xuanjiu.

40:30.840 --> 40:31.980
[Qin Xuanjiu, Mu Qingge]

40:32.590 --> 40:33.400
My master sent me

40:33.400 --> 40:34.400
to find Su Yishui.

40:35.110 --> 40:35.840
Call him out.

40:36.440 --> 40:37.360
And who is your master?

40:37.760 --> 40:39.710
My master is the world-famous

40:39.840 --> 40:40.630
Mu Qingge.

40:41.030 --> 40:41.670
What?

40:45.440 --> 40:46.560
So you're the one

40:46.590 --> 40:47.960
Master took in as a disciple on the battlefield?

40:48.840 --> 40:49.920
I've heard Master mention you.

40:50.130 --> 40:51.340
But I've never seen you in person.

40:51.950 --> 40:53.790
Though you're indeed not in line

40:54.440 --> 40:55.510
with Master's usual taste.

40:56.110 --> 40:56.800
Master

40:56.820 --> 40:57.850
said she would bring me

40:57.880 --> 40:59.190
to meet my fellow disciples after the war.

41:00.670 --> 41:01.550
But unexpectedly,

41:01.800 --> 41:03.030
she was murdered by some ungrateful

41:03.030 --> 41:03.710
bastard.

41:08.400 --> 41:09.670
Just tell us what brings you to Mount Wester.

41:12.190 --> 41:13.070
According to Master's order,

41:13.350 --> 41:14.580
I should come to find you if this compass

41:14.710 --> 41:15.670
shows any unusual movement.

41:16.190 --> 41:17.000
The compass didn't move,

41:17.200 --> 41:18.110
but for some reason,

41:18.110 --> 41:19.150
it was broken.

41:19.960 --> 41:20.840
Could it be the cause?

41:22.350 --> 41:23.450
Apart from the broken compass,

41:23.670 --> 41:24.590
is there anything else unusual?

41:25.110 --> 41:26.000
Recently,

41:26.280 --> 41:28.110
a few men in the camp went missing

41:28.360 --> 41:29.230
for no reason.

41:29.920 --> 41:31.150
When we found them,

41:31.310 --> 41:32.950
the way they died was super freaky.

41:34.110 --> 41:35.510
But this is a matter within my camp.

41:35.710 --> 41:36.440
You guys should

41:36.630 --> 41:37.230
stay out of it.

41:41.000 --> 41:41.710
Weird.

41:42.040 --> 41:42.810
Why is there

41:42.840 --> 41:43.960
a demonic aura on this compass?

41:44.390 --> 41:45.100
Nonsense!

41:45.580 --> 41:46.280
How could there be

41:46.280 --> 41:47.150
demons in my camp?

41:47.690 --> 41:48.480
If you don't believe us,

41:48.510 --> 41:49.800
you can go ask Master.

41:50.120 --> 41:50.680
See if this

41:50.710 --> 41:51.710
is really a demonic aura or not.

41:53.030 --> 41:54.280
I wish I could.

41:55.000 --> 41:55.920
I don't know why,

41:56.110 --> 41:57.480
but Master just refused to recognize me

41:58.840 --> 42:00.150
and shut me out without letting me in.

42:00.550 --> 42:01.540
According to the rules,

42:01.800 --> 42:03.000
as a border guard,

42:03.190 --> 42:04.320
I'm not allowed to enter the capital at will.

42:04.840 --> 42:05.710
That's why I could only

42:06.030 --> 42:07.000
come to Mount Wester to find you.

42:07.590 --> 42:09.030
Well, since Master instructed you

42:09.330 --> 42:10.640
to ask him about the compass thing,

42:11.240 --> 42:12.440
why don't you hear what he has to say?

42:13.150 --> 42:13.920
So,

42:14.590 --> 42:15.400
what now?

42:29.400 --> 42:31.030
It was severed by a demonic power by force.

42:31.590 --> 42:32.400
It can't be restored.

42:33.320 --> 42:34.360
This compass is related to a weighty secret

42:34.360 --> 42:35.600
entrusted by Master.

42:36.050 --> 42:37.120
The reason for its destruction

42:37.150 --> 42:38.000
is also crucial.

42:38.360 --> 42:39.150
We can't ignore it.

42:40.030 --> 42:41.230
The only clue now

42:41.550 --> 42:42.810
is the demonic aura on it.

42:43.670 --> 42:44.590
Demons

42:44.610 --> 42:45.780
always bring about anomalies.

42:46.190 --> 42:46.920
I bet

42:47.150 --> 42:48.190
the soldiers' deaths

42:48.400 --> 42:49.690
are also related to the truth behind this compass.

42:52.320 --> 42:53.360
We must make a trip to the camp.

42:58.680 --> 42:59.110
Guardian,

42:59.210 --> 42:59.960
Ranran wants to meet you.

43:00.900 --> 43:01.580
There's no time to waste.

43:01.710 --> 43:02.310
Let's set off now.

43:03.190 --> 43:04.320
In such a hurry?

43:04.950 --> 43:06.200
I haven't even eaten yet.

43:06.510 --> 43:07.880
At least let me grab a bite

43:08.280 --> 43:09.070
and worship the hall

43:09.070 --> 43:09.920
where Master used to live.

43:10.920 --> 43:12.230
Eat on the way, worship in your heart.

43:14.510 --> 43:15.680
Please arrange Ranran's training

43:15.920 --> 43:16.440
down the moutain.

43:16.920 --> 43:17.360
Okay.

43:17.810 --> 43:18.730
I'm going to inform

43:19.190 --> 43:19.920
the four of them

43:20.150 --> 43:20.960
to go together.

43:21.820 --> 43:26.050
[Grand Hall]

43:26.630 --> 43:27.920
The Guardian has gone down the mountain on business.

43:28.810 --> 43:29.890
He's left?

43:30.480 --> 43:31.800
Didn't we just have a guest?

43:32.230 --> 43:33.520
I even made some delicious food.
